Z||000000||SKIDMARK||11-07-2001||01:05 AM||||I recently bought a low mileage 3.4 out of a Camaro. When I starte preping it, I noticed these tags on a couple of the freeze plugs. Anyone have any Idea if this could have been a crate motor or does GM put these tags on their motors now?<BR>(http://pstr-m04.ygpweb.aol.com/data/008/5D/BC/37/02/qu5ZldSxN3Rp8FSvxVcf79y9nwLde1nf0112.jpg)<BR>Hope I got the picture right<P>------------------<BR>White '85 4cyl coupe<BR>Black '86 v-6 SE<BR>'81 CB900F Super Sport||||reg||5
Z||000001||Pontiaddict||11-07-2001||01:23 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://pstr-m04.ygpweb.aol.com/data/008/5D/BC/37/02/qu5ZldSxN3Rp8FSvxVcf79y9nwLde1nf0112.jpg"> <P>I can't tell. It could have been a aftermarket rebuilt engine (Cloverleaf, Jasper, etc.). Does it say GM on it?||||reg||1
