Z||000004||SKIDMARK||11-07-2001||01:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hugh:<BR><B>The tag probably is an overheat indicator that cames off if the engine reaches a certain temperature.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I never even considered that. I still would like to know if this is maybe a crate motor or aftermarket rebuild. It would mean that there would have to be less miles on it than the 40K on the car's odometer. I like the idea of that!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
